# VideoTrans runs entirely on this machine. Nothing here is required to dub a
# video: the pipeline, the models and the projects are all local. Copy this
# file to .env only if you want one of the optional things below.

# --- Script intelligence (optional) ------------------------------------
# Only used to rewrite a phrase that runs past its slot. The default is a
# local model through Ollama, which sends nothing anywhere. Set a key here
# only if you would rather use a hosted model for that one rewrite - it is
# the single stage that can leave this machine.
#
# Pick ONE, or none:
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...            # Groq Cloud   (api.groq.com)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...    # Claude
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...           # OpenAI
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...              # Gemini
# XAI_API_KEY=xai-...             # Grok, which is a different company to Groq

# Which provider and model to use. Both can also be set in the studio's
# Script model panel, which writes ~/.videotrans/llm.json instead.
# VIDEOTRANS_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
# VIDEOTRANS_LLM_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b

# Where Ollama is listening, if not the default.
# VIDEOTRANS_LLM_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434

# For the OpenAI-compatible "Other" provider, which has no vendor name to hang
# a variable on. VIDEOTRANS_LLM_CUSTOM_URL is the endpoint root, without
# /chat/completions. VIDEOTRANS_LLM_API_KEY is the key for whichever provider is
# selected, so it also works for a first-party provider under a shorter name.
# VIDEOTRANS_LLM_CUSTOM_URL=https://your-server/v1
# VIDEOTRANS_LLM_API_KEY=...

# Turn script intelligence off entirely.
# VIDEOTRANS_LLM=off

# --- Models ------------------------------------------------------------
# Needed for gated repos on the Hugging Face Hub. One model VideoTrans ships
# with is gated: ai4bharat/IndicF5, the voice model. To use it, accept its
# licence at https://huggingface.co/ai4bharat/IndicF5, create a READ token at
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens, and put it here. Without it the
# Indian languages are marked unavailable and a download of that one model is
# skipped - everything else works. Full steps: docs/GATED-MODELS.md
# HF_TOKEN=hf_...

# --- Housekeeping ------------------------------------------------------
# How long an abandoned working directory survives before it is swept.
# Projects you have saved are never swept.
# VIDEOTRANS_SWEEP_HOURS=48
